                    <occupation>poet</occupation>
                    <note type="editorial">
                        <p>Mrs Cowley is recorded in the 1796 list for the year 1796, 
    and there is one entry to her - an 'adv' meeting with Holcroft at the theatre. 
    The next entry records her death in 1809. </p>
                        <p> There are many references to reading Cowley, but this seems most likely to be Araham Cowley, rather than Hannah, although she was an accomplished poet as well as a playwright.
     There is also a reference on 4 May 1829 to a 'Cowley br'. This is not coded. 
     </p>
